# panel-card-johto 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel (Class F
# card): the ARC COMPLETE card for arc johto. Original
# in-house art, generated deterministically by w10c-rig/
# gen-panels-t2.mjs. Brief = the arc record: "Lastlight
# Conference — HONOURS." / "Eight badges, the beasts woken and
# quieted, and the rivalry settled at last in the conference
# fire." Dusk: Yamato's two old towers stand quiet — the tall
# tiered tower, the gutted one — and the conference fire
# burns between them; eight badge glints on the brazier base
# = the recorded eight badges.
